            "Careless / Arithmetic"
          ],
          "text": "Rounded $\\int_0^{0.1} t^2\\cos(t^3)\\,\\mathrm{d}t \\approx \\frac{0.1^3}{3} - \\frac{0.1^9}{18} + \\frac{0.1^{15}}{360}$ to 3 s.f. instead of 5 d.p. ($0.00033$), and initially wrote $3! = 6$ wrongly in the coefficient denominator.",
          "updatedAt": "23/11/2026"
        }
